package app

// The `app` layer is the runnable application: the gala_tui UI (`app/ui`) and,
// in a later milestone, the migration engine (`app/engine`) behind its public
// port. This file declares the `app` package so the directory is a real
// package — the cmd entrypoint imports `app/ui` through it, and the toolchain's
// test workspace resolves the nested package path correctly.

// LayerName identifies this layer in diagnostics.
func LayerName() string = "app"
